@startuml
title MailQueue entry FSM — lease-based exactly-one-sender-at-a-time (mail_queue.rho)
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #ECF5FC
  BorderColor #477B9B
  StartColor #2F7C5A
  EndColor #7D478F
  ArrowColor #496174
}

state "queued\n(claimable when\nnextAttempt <= now)" as queued #E9F5EA
state "leased\n{worker, expiresAt}" as leased #FFF0D9
state "leased, lease expired\n(claimable; outcome of the\nprior attempt UNKNOWN)" as ambiguous #FFE0C8
state "delivered\n(terminal)" as delivered #D9EFDF
state "bounced\n(terminal; DSN recorded)" as bounced #F8DADA

[*] --> queued : enqueue -- idempotent on the content\nfingerprint: a duplicate answers\n("duplicate", original qid), creates nothing
queued --> leased : lease(qid, worker, ttl, now)\n-> ("leased", qid, expiry)
leased --> leased : lease while unexpired\n-> ("busy", holder) -- refused
leased --> ambiguous : now > expiresAt\n(no transition on chain;\na queryable fact, not a guess)
ambiguous --> leased : lease by a new worker\n-> ("leased-ambiguous", qid, expiry):\nthe caller is TOLD the prior outcome\nis unknown -- consult the run ledger\n(claimRun/lookupRun) before re-acting
leased --> delivered : delivered(qid, worker, response, now)\n-- lease holder only
leased --> queued : defer(qid, worker, code, nextAttemptAt)\n-- attempts + 1, lease cleared
leased --> bounced : bounce(qid, worker, code, dsnRef, now)
delivered --> [*]
bounced --> [*]

note right of ambiguous #FFF6C9
The known unknown Postfix cannot name: the
prior worker may or may not have completed
its SMTP transaction before dying. Here the
ambiguity is queryable, so the retry decision
is policy rather than a guess -- the teams
bridge resolves it against its own
fingerprint-keyed run ledger.
end note

note bottom of delivered #FFF0C7
Outcome writes are fenced to the lease holder:
a stale worker back from the dead cannot
overwrite the attempt that replaced it.
Mutations forward their acknowledgment to the
deploy id, so outcomes are readable after
finality; reads answer on a ret channel for
observer exploratory readback
(MAIL_QUEUE_ARITIES pins both against the
contract source).
end note
@enduml
